{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve \\( f(f(f(f(512)))) \\), we need to evaluate the function \\( f \\) step by step. Let's start with the innermost function and work our way out.\n\n1. **First evaluation: \\( f(512) \\)**\n\n   Given \\( 512 \\geq 0 \\), we use the first case of the piecewise function:\n   \\[\n   f(512) = -\\sqrt[3]{512}\n   \\]\n   Calculate the cube root of 512:\n   \\[\n   \\sqrt[3]{512} = 8\n   \\]\n   Therefore,\n   \\[\n   f(512) = -8\n   \\]\n\n2. **Second evaluation: \\( f(f(512)) = f(-8) \\)**\n\n   Given \\( -8 < 0 \\), we use the second case of the piecewise function:\n   \\[\n   f(-8) = (-8)^2\n   \\]\n   Calculate the square of -8:\n   \\[\n   (-8)^2 = 64\n   \\]\n   Therefore,\n   \\[\n   f(-8) = 64\n   \\]\n\n","prefix_end":667,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,17767,282,955,955,955,7,20,16,17,25759,1124,701,582,1184,311,15442,279,729,17767,282,1124,8,3019,553,3019,13,6771,594,1191,448,279,9179,3562,729,323,975,1039,1616,700,382,16,13,3070,5338,16460,25,17767,282,7,20,16,17,8,1124,32295,271,256,16246,17767,220,20,16,17,1124,709,80,220,15,1124,701,582,990,279,1156,1142,315,279,6573,4482,729,510,256,1124,9640,256,282,7,20,16,17,8,284,481,59,26888,58,18,15370,20,16,17,532,256,1124,921,256,20517,279,23739,3704,315,220,20,16,17,510,256,1124,9640,256,1124,26888,58,18,15370,20,16,17,92,284,220,23,198,256,1124,921,256,15277,345,256,1124,9640,256,282,7,20,16,17,8,284,481,23,198,256,1124,2533,17,13,3070,15666,16460,25,17767,282,955,7,20,16,17,593,284,282,4080,23,8,1124,32295,271,256,16246,17767,481,23,366,220,15,1124,701,582,990,279,2086,1142,315,279,6573,4482,729,510,256,1124,9640,256,282,4080,23,8,284,10293,23,29776,17,198,256,1124,921,256,20517,279,9334,315,481,23,510,256,1124,9640,256,10293,23,29776,17,284,220,21,19,198,256,1124,921,256,15277,345,256,1124,9640,256,282,4080,23,8,284,220,21,19,198,256